Sub-range requests inside known spans (rdata T-subset), mark adjustment on
delete, and dot/mark clamping after deleting past the mark.

-- input --
alpha
beta
gamma
delta
epsilon
zeta
-- proto --
Hversion 2
Hnewname tag=0
Hmovname tag=0 "input"
Tversion 2
Tstartcmdfile
Hnewname tag=1
Hbindname tag=1
Hcurrent tag=1
Hmovname tag=1 "~~sam~~"
Hcheck0 tag=1
Hack
Tack
Hunlock
Tstartfile 0
Hbindname tag=0
Hcurrent tag=0
Hgrow tag=0 p=0 n=36
Hcheck0 tag=0
Hcheck0 tag=0
Hack
Tack
Hgrow tag=1 p=0 n=10
Hcheck0 tag=1
Hack
Tack
Hsetdot tag=1 p=10 n=10
Hunlock
Trequest 0 0 20
Hdata tag=0 p=0 "alpha\nbeta\ngamma\ndel"
Trequest 0 5 5
Hdata tag=0 p=5 ""
Trequest 0 15 10
Hdata tag=0 p=20 "ta\nep"
cmd $k\n
Hunlock
cmd 1,2d\n
Hdirty tag=0
Hcut tag=0 p=0 n=11
Hcheck0 tag=0
Hack
Tack
Hunlock
cmd ,d\n
